# No em dashes

Never use an em dash (U+2014) anywhere: UI copy, changelog items, comments,
docs, commit messages, or replies to the user.

Use a period, a comma, a colon, or a hyphen with spaces (` - `) instead.

Good: "All done. Extra message unlocked for today."
Bad: "All done" followed by an em dash and "extra message unlocked for today."

Do not "clean up" an existing em dash by swapping in an en dash (U+2013).
The only exception is matching punctuation that already exists in
outside data (for example a RealmEye title), never in text we write.
